raph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-depth Targeting and Sensors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320850/extras/fa15657baa4ba0301c8ac0a374d791d4.poster.avif?t=1759934429\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320850/extras/fa15657baa4ba0301c8ac0a374d791d4.webm?t=1759934429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320850/extras/fa15657baa4ba0301c8ac0a374d791d4.mp4?t=1759934429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Manipulate infrared heat signatures using deep sensor mechanics to track targets, get firing solutions and evade enemy targeting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320850/extras/5da3c8c1ce12f7510cd492a4557c30fc.poster.avif?t=1759934429\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320850/extras/5da3c8c1ce12f7510cd492a4557c30fc.webm?t=1759934429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320850/extras/5da3c8c1ce12f7510cd492a4557c30fc.mp4?t=1759934429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the turbulent waters of the Exiled Empire's war of reconquest in a dynamic campaign that poses new challenges, adventures and decisions with every playthrough. Choose your path through the warzone wisely to secure vital upgrades and resources for your strike-group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
